- ## stenography
+ ## stenography

- - `stenography.Designator.fromUrl(text: Text): Designator` and `stenography.Designator#url:
-   Text` removed, with no replacement: neither was used, and they were not inverses of each
-   other (`fromUrl` replaced `~` with `#` without URL-decoding). `Designator(text)` parses the
-   `#`-separated form. (#2176)
+ - `stenography.Designator.fromUrl(text: Text): Designator` и
+   `stenography.Designator#url: Text` удалены без замены: ни один не использовался, и они не были
+   взаимно обратными (`fromUrl` заменял `~` на `#` без URL-декодирования). `Designator(text)`
